= test end_to_end_fields_are_passed_on_unchanged

@ 11.7.1
> A proxy MUST send at least one Proxy-Authenticate header field in each 407 (Proxy Authentication Required) response that it generates.
= unused proxy authentication: shioko never generates 407

@ 12.4.2
> A sender of qvalue MUST NOT generate more than three digits after the decimal point.
= peer client: nothing to do; Accept fields are forwarded unparsed, and shioko generates no qvalue anywhere

