> Senders using weights SHOULD send "q" last (after all media-range parameters).
= peer client: nothing to do; Accept is forwarded unparsed, and shioko generates no Accept field
> Recipients SHOULD process any parameter named "q" as weight, regardless of parameter ordering.
= unused content negotiation: shioko selects no representation; Accept is forwarded unparsed for the upstream to process

